# Workspace-level ignores

# Node / Next.js build artifacts (workspace-wide)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.vercel/

# Logs
**/*.log

# Env files (keep secrets out of git)
**/.env*

# Local backups / exports (avoid accidentally committing huge binaries)
/Backup 1/

# Large archives
*.rar

# Temp marker files
**/Temp.txt

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
